  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Academic Spaces with Sexual and Generic Diversities, Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive environments in higher education for persons with diverse sexual orientation and gender identity and expression through thematic workshops, production of research and use of it in advocacy, psychosocial support, events/conference related to SOGIE, advocacy and awareness raising campaigns towards HEI and Bolivian society.</narrative>
  </description>
